+Source: libxtst
+Section: x11
+Priority: optional
+Maintainer: Debian X Strike Force <debian-x@lists.debian.org>
+Build-Depends:
+ debhelper-compat (= 13),
+ libx11-dev,
+ libxext-dev,
+ libxi-dev,
+ x11proto-dev,
+ pkgconf,
+ xutils-dev,
+ quilt,
